      "Josh's Updates" {b}
[027] indent=0 block=-
[028] indent=6 block=34cdbe27
      "• "
      "Initial OPEC setup is nearly complete with a couple of PRs still"
[029] indent=6 block=34cdbe27
      "  "
      "outstanding "
[030] indent=6 block=34cdbe27
      "• "
      "Hallucination metric is currently showing around 45%, which is "
[031] indent=6 block=34cdbe27
      "  "
