[032] indent=6 block=34cdbe27
      "  "
      "60% "
[033] indent=6 block=34cdbe27
      "• "
      "Next steps include setting up regular measurements (twice "
[034] indent=6 block=34cdbe27
      "  "
      "weekly) against dev/main "
[035] indent=6 block=34cdbe27
      "• "
      "Plans to work on validating the hallucination score quality "
[036] indent=6 block=34cdbe27
