      "DataFrame Snapshots Discussion" {b}
[048] indent=0 block=-
[049] indent=6 block=34cdbe27
      "• "
      "Joel is proposing that each snapshot creates a Databricks table "
[050] indent=6 block=34cdbe27
      "• "
      "Not every EQ Warehouse call will be saved - users will need to "
[051] indent=6 block=34cdbe27
      "  "
      "explicitly request saving queries as tables "
[052] indent=6 block=34cdbe27
      "• "
      "Users won't see table names or direct links to Databricks  "
[053] indent=6 block=34cdbe27
      "• "
      "Citations will be clickable in chat to show data in a floating "
[054] indent=6 block=34cdbe27
      "  "
      "table window within the UI, similar to what Danny has built  "
[055] indent=6 block=34cdbe27
      "• "
      "The data frame appears as a floating table in the UI, not inline"
[056] indent=6 block=34cdbe27
      "  "
      "with chat "
